@3468. When this quasi human body was let down towards the middle of Gehenna, those who are in Gehenna felt a certain change... From this it was evident that their lasciviousness was much more criminal than that of those who are in Gehenna; and therefore it could not be let into it. The fire of Gehenna is redder...

