@286. The confession and glorification of the Lord by the Angels of the lower Heavens. Signified. [Here, glorification is being used in the sense of its meaning "praise".] @AE 335.

@290. The confession and glorification of the Lord by the Angels of the lowest Heavens. Signified. [Here, glorification is being used in the sense of its meaning "praise".] @AE 342.

